# infra-copilot configuration

Rendered by copier from the answers in `.copier-answers.yml`. These are public
deployment identifiers. Never put credentials or secrets here. Change a value by
running `copier update` or `copier recopy`, not by hand-editing, so the Terraform `cloud`
blocks stay aligned.
